<title>USA: Furniture Brands International Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Furniture Brands International Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.27		    $0.19</p>
<p> Net			 17,059		   10,847</p>
<p> Revs		     449,861		  423,947</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,732		   55,982</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: EPS adjusted to remove depreciation and amortization related to 1992 asset revaluation, net of taxes, would be $0.32 for Q1 1997 and $0.25 for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Full co name is Furniture Brands International Inc.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
